{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601660/extras/1868b91f2f3c11514b2d4e3896b3840c.avif?t=1751911291\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601660/extras_big/1868b91f2f3c11514b2d4e3896b3840c.avif?t=1751911291 width=800 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this parallel fantasy land, everyone is ruled by the supreme king. Due to the queen\u2019s betrayal, the king\u2019s soul was replaced by a demon who opened a portal to hell. You are a lone ninja, ready to fight for the human race, prepare for this adventure, in this game action-platformer <strong>Ninja Ruins!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601660/extras/76920a6a4d1f9cc909c2cb7590bce032.avif?t=1751911291\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action and combat with enemies from different biomes and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601660/extras/0eaef999407ec084f2e15c36e84ccd71.avif?t=1751911291\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, evade, and escape from various traps along the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601660/extras/1d31c6a6d7882708d2d1ce955a8bfdde.avif?t=1751911291\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, use skills and become stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601660/extras/708e2a58298a